    "text": "tennesseevalleyoutsider.com\nwebsite\nHuntsville\nGreenway Grand Prix 5K: Nails, Sillivant Battle to the Tape\nBy Alan Clemons,\n7 hours agoHunter Nails and Daniel Sillivant raced to the tape for a thrilling finish to kick off the summer Greenway Grand Prix series on June 20. The series consists of four Friday evening races, all held on flat and fast greenways in Huntsville. The 5K race was held on Aldridge Creek Greenway. Similar to the Running Lane summer and winter Wild Thangs trail series events, the Greenway Grand Prix races increase in distance with each event.",
